The runner's own tests.

Every file here is an EXPECTED OUTCOME of tests/fletch/run.c, and most
of them are supposed to FAIL -- that is the point.  A test runner that
silently passes is worse than no runner, so the failure paths get the
same treatment as the language does.

Run by `make test-fletch-meta`, which asserts the exact totals.  The
real suite never collects this directory.
